{"id":"vod_hh_73047","vodId":"73047","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"战国妖狐 救世姐弟篇","name_cn":"战国妖狐 救世姐弟篇","date":"2024-01-01","year":"2024","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第13集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/d334e1b322c61cfbac4352b1ea6a9470.jpg"},"summary":"时间为战国时代，世上所具有的各种魑魅魍魉、异形妖怪等非人灵力生物总称为”暗“。喜欢人类的暗——妖狐玉，以及厌恶人类的仙道——迅火，成立了名为“救世姐弟”的组合进行著扫荡罪恶的救世活动，途中遇上了武士兵头真介。另外还有一群专门对付暗的僧侣·断怪众，他们为了消灭对人类作恶的暗“障怪”的以不人道的方式进行人体改造，迅火等人与他们产生激烈冲突！人类当中也有坏人，非人类的存在也不见得都是邪恶的，迅火因过去的事而极其讨厌人类，但在旅程当中，也逐渐目睹到人类善良的一面，他是否能有所转变呢。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-04-03 23:30:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aALWPpe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQxRjLe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penA3Ppd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQx3ZYe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DdwzE5gb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVqrn1d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YerrG5Be/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/PdyBEqge/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DdwzYggb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penqGV5d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaOn2nRe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepvA2Xb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb2m6g1a/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:46:06.777Z"}